{"id":"vod_bf_10560","vodId":"10560","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"干物妹！小埋","name_cn":"干物妹！小埋","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-11/add78beedfd5f0ba7e7b322a5ef5c834.jpg"},"summary":"土间埋（田中爱美 配音），校园中女神一般的存在，成绩优异体育万能，个性温柔正直善良，然而，只有她的哥哥太平（野岛健儿 配音）知道，众人眼中光芒万丈的小埋，在进入家门的那一刹那，就会瞬间变成披着仓鼠斗篷，满地打滚，除了吃就是睡和玩的超级干物女。　　海老名菜菜（影山灯 配音）是小埋的好友，两人住在同一间公寓中，常常和太平以及小埋一同吃饭。本场切绘（白石晴香 配音）在无意之中捡到了小埋的学生证，于是一路找到了小埋家。橘（古川由里奈 配音）将在学校中视小埋为最强劲的对手，却在没有认出小埋的情况下和她成为了好友。最终，这些女孩子们是否会发现小埋的真实身份呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 01:35:38","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/ganwumeixiaomai/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/ganwumeixiaomai/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/ganwumeixiaomai/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/ganwumeixiaomai/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/ganwumeixiaomai/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/ganwumeixiaomai/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/ganwumeixiaomai/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/ganwumeixiaomai/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/ganwumeixiaomai/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/ganwumeixiaomai/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/ganwumeixiaomai/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/ganwumeixiaomai/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:33:09.429Z"}